WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.680
I put a black phone in the city centre.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.900
We will see whether anyone gathers enough courage to pick up the receiver.

3
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.320
People walked past and looked on in surprise.

4
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.280
But nobody has the courage yet to pick up the receiver.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.440
It looks like somebody is interested after all.

6
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.580
From this moment the game has begun.

7
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.260
Somewhere in the city centre there is a yellow suitcase.

8
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:22.120
You have a minute to find it. Good luck.

9
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:23.920
Come on over here, over here, over here.

10
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.800
Here it is, let's see what we have.

11
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.800
Your next task is to find Luka Averić. Good luck.

12
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.000
Rato, have you seen Luka Averić? The TikToker.

13
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Come on, we are all looking for him.

14
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.400
And he has surely hidden somewhere.

15
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.800
Well, we will find him somewhere.

16
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.800
Have you seen Luka anywhere? We need to find him.

17
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.400
May I give you a bouquet of flowers?

18
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.600
Oh, may you live long and be healthy.

19
00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.300
Do you maybe follow me on social media?

20
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.900
Now yes, honestly not before today.

21
00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:05.400
Since you said you follow me, you deserve 100 euros.
